Milestone: Start with discreet bottom-left tools and reveal them on console activation.
Dependencies: Existing movable console-tools dock and scene view notifications.
Purpose: Keep the initial desk unobstructed, revealing console tools when
either console is clicked without changing the separate Lighting/Pear controls.

Tasks:
- [x] Start with hidden actions and matching accessible expand-button state.
- [x] Place the unmoved collapsed grip at the safe-area-aware bottom-left.
- [x] Expand for console selection and real active-console model clicks.
