Acceptance criteria:
Reload starts collapsed at bottom-left. Either console reveals its actions,
including an already-active console picked directly in the 3D scene.
Lighting/Pear controls do not expand it. User-moved positioning persists
for this session; putting a console down does not force another collapse.
No claim of new public publication or physical-device qualification.

